<!--
  Distributed template OVERLAY for repository/conf/registry.xml.j2, applied to every component (CP, TM, Gateway).

  This is NOT a full template. Each leaf value below is written into the component image's own template (extracted
  next to its deployment.toml under target/distributed-apim/defaults/<component>/templates/) at the same element
  path (J2TemplateOverlay), and the result is copied into the component before boot.

  enableCache: the registry resource cache is off, as in the all-in-one lane's basic overlay. Under the suite's
  concurrent CRUD load, a read of an API artifact that lands while another request is writing it re-caches the
  previous version, and that write can then commit the stale content. Product default is true.
-->
<wso2registry>
    <enableCache>false</enableCache>
</wso2registry>
